WEBVTT

00:02:58.261 --> 00:03:03.122
(Beatboxing)

00:03:03.146 --> 00:03:04.297
or --

00:03:04.321 --> 00:03:10.017
(Beatboxing)

00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:11.868
Those were simple beats.

00:03:11.892 --> 00:03:16.294
But now, you got folks that want
to do all type of stuff

00:03:16.318 --> 00:03:17.535
with their beats now,

00:03:17.559 --> 00:03:19.948
and they want to humiliate their father,

00:03:19.972 --> 00:03:23.222
which is not right when you want
to humiliate the person

00:03:23.246 --> 00:03:26.112
that take care of you, pay
all your tuition, (Nicole laughs)

00:03:26.136 --> 00:03:28.523
especially when you have 50 million people

00:03:28.547 --> 00:03:30.664
that just go around
and call you "the loser."